    pr_ref:  # 9e4b
    description: "No way to visualize the dependency tree for an item and its children/dependents. After setting up 9 PlazaFlow items with parent and before relationships, verification required running 'tracker show' on each item individually (9 commands). A 'tracker deps <item>' command should show the tree: parent/child hierarchy plus before/blocked-by edges. Could also support --format dot for Graphviz output. Example: 'tracker deps META-migil' would show the full PlazaFlow readiness tree with arrows indicating blocking relationships."  # 9e4b
